// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1039303786" "Greetings, {HeroName}. I am <color yellow>Operative Kuzmin</color>, and I am here today as a representative of <color yellow>Arachnos</color>.<br><br>Your ruthlessness has been recognized, and Arachnos would like the opportunity to help you grow in your power.<br><br>Already, there are forces at work here in Mercy Island who would seek to stop your... destiny, before it begins."
// Answer Text :
"P1877773907" "What forces?"
// Answer Text :
"P3708734407" "Kuzmin? I saw your brother, in Galaxy."
// Answer Text :
"P644649227" "Why should I accept? What is Arachnos?"
// Page WhoAreArachnos Text :
"P205088495" "An excellent question. Arachnos is the organization that rules over the Rogue Isles.<br><br>We are led by <color red>Lord Recluse</color>. We protect the Rogue Isles and all the supers that inhabit it from those so-called 'do-gooders' in Paragon City. If you are in the Isles, you can rest assured that you are... <i>supposed</i> to be protected from <color yellow>Longbow</color>, an organization who claim to bring law and orders to all parts of the globe."
// Answer Text :
"P3244066191" "Alright, and what forces are stopping you?"
// Page Forces Text :
"P157704474" "<color yellow>Longbow</color>. They have <i>attacked</i> Mercy Island and taken over our Fort Darwin. Now, they seek to spread their so-called 'law and order' and take over the rest of Mercy Island.<br><br>Even now, there are Longbow soldiers inside of Mercy City itself, trying to bring down Arachnos, and, more importantly, super-powered beings such as <i>yourself</i>.<br><br>You see, then, the current scenario you are in. If something is not done, if we do not work together, then we risk Longbow taking over the rest of Mercy, sending us all back to their prisons in Paragon."
// Answer Text :
"P851793362" "Longbow knows that I'm here?"
// Page Brother Text :
"P1009254603" "My brother?<br><br>Hrmph, from my old family, perhaps. I do not care much for whatever he was doing, {HeroName}. When I joined Arachnos, I gave up on my old family.<br><br><i>Arachnos</i> is my family now. My life, my goals, are all shared with the goals of Arachnos. My old family was <i>weak</i>, this family is <i>strong</i>.<br><br>Now, let us get down to business regading the forces here that seek to stop you."
// Answer Text :
"P1584569780" "Very well. Who is trying to stop me?"
// Page Recover2 Text :
"P4160539052" "They do, and they are after you and every person <i>like</i> you at this very moment. It is no secret that the Rogue Isles is a breeding ground for... More unsavory types.<br><br>Longbow seeks to stop this and enforce their own laws. But we will not let them do so in Mercy Island, {HeroName}. Let us push these red and white soldiers back to Paragon and make them know <i>fear</i>."
// Answer Text :
"P4124785633" "Let's do this."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Widow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page AccountServerDown Text :
"P1409527826" "Galaxy has become a reflection of Paragon, {HeroName}; a mess that is becoming worse by the minute. These Shivans appear to become more powerful by the minute. It is interesting, I suppose.<br><br>Regardless, there is nothing more to be done here. We in <color red>Arachnos</color> will help get you out of the city. Afterwards, all will be explained by <color yellow>Operative Kuzmin</color>."
// Answer Text :
"P1822809086" "(Go to Mercy Island)"
// Page TeleportPage Text :
"P856364347" ""
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page DidntBuyProduct Text :
"P2149110045" "Galaxy has become a reflection of Paragon, {HeroName}; a mess that is becoming worse by the minute. These Shivans appear to become more powerful by the minute. It is interesting, I suppose.<br><br>Regardless, there is nothing more to be done here. We in <color red>Arachnos</color> will help get you out of the city. Afterwards, all will be explained by <color yellow>Operative Kuzmin</color>.<br><br>You shall need to understand how the <color yellow>Paragon Market</color> works before leaving, however; it has many items that would allow you to easily dominate any hero that should cross your path. Claim the <color yellow>FREE New Player Pack and Knowledgeable badge by clicking on the icon below</color>, then speak to me once more.<br><br><span align=center><a href='cmd:web_store_open_product ctsyknow'><img src=icon_ig_storeaccess_color_full.tga></a><br>Shop</span><br><br><span align=center><color yellow>You can visit the Market at any time by clicking on this icon on your main screen.</color></span>"
// Answer Text :
"P3029899418" "(Claim the FREE New Player Pack now)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Widow2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page AccountServerDown Text :
"P2199723226" "Excellent work, {HeroName}.<br><br>The more you take from that store, the easier it will be to take the fight to those heroes. Take the Arachnos flyer now to Mercy, there is much to do."
// Page BoughtProduct Text :
"P962904507" "Excellent work, {HeroName}.<br><br>The more you take from that store, the easier it will be to take the fight to those heroes. You must go to Mercy Island now, but before you do, I will explain how to claim the items you've purchased from the Paragon Market.."
// Answer Text :
"P154229843" "(View the item claim tutorial)"
// Page ItemClaim1 Text :
"P1912096159" "Click on the <color yellow>Email</color> button on your chat window.<br><img src=NPopHelpEmail1.tga><br><br>Then, click on <color yellow>Character items</color><br><img src=NPopHelpEmail2.tga><br><br>Click on the item you wish to claim, then hit the claim button.<br><img src=NPopHelpEmail3.tga>"
// Answer Text :
"P3273531036" "(View how to use temporary powers)"
// Page ItemClaim2 Text :
"P1640985801" "Click on the <color yellow>Powers</color> button on your powers bar window.<br><img src=NPopHelpEmail4.tga><br><br>Then, click on the power you want to add to your power bar.<br><img src=NPopHelpEmail5.tga>"
// Page TimerNotFinishedPage Text :
"P1561445762" "You need to understand how the <color yellow>Paragon Market</color> works before leaving; it has many items that will aid you in destroying the heroes of Paragon.Claim the <color yellow>FREE New Player Pack and Knowledgeable badge by clicking on the icon below</color>.<br><br><br><br><br><br><br><span align=center><a href='cmd:web_store_open_product ctsyknow'><img src=icon_ig_storeaccess_color_full.tga></a><br>Shop</span><br><br><br><span align=center><color yellow>You can visit the Market at any time by clicking on this icon on your main screen.</color></span>"
// Page DidntBuyProduct Text :
"P3170900454" "You need to understand how the <color yellow>Paragon Market</color> works before leaving; it has many items that will aid you in destroying the heroes of Paragon. Claim the <color yellow>FREE New Player Pack and Knowledgeable badge by clicking on the icon below</color>, then speak to me once more.<br><br><br><br><br><br><br><span align=center><a href='cmd:web_store_open_product ctsyknow'><img src=icon_ig_storeaccess_color_full.tga></a><br>Shop</span><br><br><br><span align=center><color yellow>You can visit the Market at any time by clicking on this icon on your main screen.</color></span>"
// Answer Text :
"P3330498022" "I'm ready to move forward, I'll look at the store later."
// Page MoveForward Text :
"P4252227907" ""Very well, just remember, the more you take from that store, the easier it will be to take the fight to those heroes. Take the Arachnos flyer now to Mercy, there is much to do."

